E</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">豆包工作正式接入DeepSeek、Kimi与GLM模型，支持企业统一调用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/38c13e061176179fc3f13e045d546db2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">豆包工作正式面向企业客户上线第三方大模型服务，首批接入Kimi 3.1 Pro、GLM 5.3及DeepSeek V4.1 Flash。该功能打破了传统模型厂商单独采购模式，企业用户可在同一工作台内根据长文本、代码编写或逻辑推理等任务需求，灵活切换不同模型。此服务面向团队及企业订阅版客户开放，无需额外付费，系统调用时直接扣除企业账号内现有AI点数。为保障数据安全与管理效率，平台提供精细化管控权限，管理员可按成员、部门或群组划分开放范围，并支持按厂商批量启用或单独开关模型。此外，管理员可限定模型生效的终端环境，包括豆包电脑端、移动端、网页端及飞书内豆包工作，确保敏感数据不外泄。此次更新旨在提升企业AI工具选型与集中管控的灵活性，后续平台将持续接入更多第三方大模型以丰富生态。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌AI搜索冲击广告业务，第三季度搜索广告收入不及预期</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3d4c56ca5191ff6c5b5ae4b6a63a0c6f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌AI搜索冲击广告业务，第三季度搜索广告收入不及预期AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Oct 30, 202614谷歌在2026年第三季度财报电话会议上披露，AI Mode生成式搜索正在对传统搜索广告业务造成一定冲击，AI生成的摘要和回答降低了搜索结果的商业变现空间。谷歌首席商务官Philipp Schindler表示，AI回答改变了搜索结果的呈现方式，也使广告业务的变现难度增加。财务数据显示，谷歌第三季度搜索广告收入达到634亿美元，同比增长12%，但仍低于华尔街预期约16亿美元，增速也未达到分析师预测的15%。财报公布后，Alphabet股价周四盘中一度下跌13%，市值蒸发超过5000亿美元，创下该公司单日市值损失纪录。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI撤回ChatGPT Pro额度削减计划并宣布全线订阅档位用量翻倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dd755b64da7d8ada7c3fbf028ebda74.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于10月29日正式宣布，撤回此前计划削减ChatGPT Pro订阅额度的决定，并对Pro 100、Pro 200、Pro 500及Business Premium档位的Work与Codex用量额度进行翻倍调整。此次调整即刻生效，老用户无需等待续订即可享受权益提升，Dots常驻AI助理的扩展用量则保持独立计算。此前，OpenAI曾于9月29日通知拟将Pro 200额度砍半，引发订阅用户强烈不满。尽管此次额度翻倍，但OpenAI提醒用户，实际任务产出受模型类型、任务复杂度、上下文长度及工具调用影响。特别是Fast模式的额度消耗约为标准模式的2.5倍，而Ultrafast模式消耗则高达8倍。对于重度依赖高速模式的用户而言，此次调整在产能释放方面的实际效能仍取决于具体使用场景与模式选择。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Mistral AI开源旗舰模型Large 4权重，参数量达1T且支持商业化使用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/683c6b65aaf72e4616cc633e8243ae31.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Mistral AI于10月29日正式开源其旗舰模型Mistral Large 4（代号le Chonk）的权重，允许开发者与企业进行修改、微调及常规商业化应用。该模型基于修改版MIT许可证发布，仅针对MaaS转售业务设置了单独授权门槛。Mistral Large 4是一款原生多模态模型，总参数量达1万亿，激活参数为490亿，由3800块NVIDIA Grace Blackwell GPU在欧洲自有数据中心训练完成。在性能表现上，该模型在Artificial Analysis Coding Agent Index中获得48%得分，与GLM-5.3持平，但平均任务Token消耗降低了47%。Mistral通过提供高能效的编程智能体能力与极具竞争力的API定价（输入每百万Token 0.70美元），旨在通过降低调用</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">GitHub发布Copilot Fusion，支持多模型自动编排与智能路由</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9928d0aeeab9995902d9f1ee9e403590.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">GitHub在Universe 2026大会上正式发布Copilot Fusion，这是一款智能编排层，可自动路由并组合OpenAI、Anthropic、Google等多家AI模型完成编码任务。该功能整合了Project HydraFusion的多模型编排能力，开发者无需手动选择模型，系统会根据任务复杂度自动匹配单一模型、级联或评审模式，并提供Standard、High、Max三档努力等级以平衡效率与成本。在Artificial Analysis Coding Agent Index评测中，Copilot Fusion Max表现优异，相比Claude Code Opus 5.5 Max，其平均API成本降低约50%，Token消耗减半，任务完成速度提升约40%。该功能已全面覆盖VS Code、CLI及JetB</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
